<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>USPS First-Class Mail Letter (FCML), sometimes called Plain White Envelope (PWE) shipping, is a lower-cost way to ship small, lightweight items like trading cards or stickers.</p>
        <p>Since buyers typically pay shipping on Lively, FCML helps keep costs down when your order qualifies. If it does, it'll automatically ship this way.</p>

        <p><strong>In this article:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#expect">What to expect with FCML</a></li>
            <li><a href="#which-orders">Which orders ship with FCML?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#cost">How much does FCML shipping cost?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#more-help">Need more help?</a></li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="expect">What to expect with FCML</h2>

        <p>FCML travels through USPS letter mail instead of as a package, so tracking can look different from other shipments.</p>

        <p><strong>In Lively, you might notice:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>Tracking updates are limited or USPS.com doesn't show details at all</li>
            <li>The order details page says "First-Class Mail Letter tracking unavailable"</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Limited or unavailable tracking is expected for FCML shipments and doesn't automatically mean there's a problem.</p>
        <p>You'll still see your <a href="#">order status</a> and delivery confirmation in Lively.</p>
        <p>FCML shipments typically arrive within 5–14 business days after shipment.</p>

        <div class="article-image-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <h2 id="which-orders">Which orders ship with FCML?</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>The item is in <a href="#">Trading Card Games, Sports Cards, or Stickers categories</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">The seller enabled FCML during a live show</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">The shipment is domestic within the U.S.</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Total weight is 3 oz or less</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Total value is $20 or less</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">5 cards or fewer are included</a></li>
        </ul>

        <p>If an order exceeds these limits, it automatically upgrades to a fully tracked shipping service such as USPS Ground Advantage or Priority Mail. If this happens, you'll pay the upgraded shipping cost, and see the final shipping price before checkout.</p>

        <h2 id="cost">How much does FCML shipping cost?</h2>

        <p>FCML label prices currently range from $0.74 to $1.32, depending on weight and current USPS rates, plus a small Lively service fee.</p>
        <p>You'll always see the exact shipping cost at checkout before you complete your purchase, and in your receipt after purchase.</p>

